  "description": "Packed with nuts, dried fruit, carrots, apples, and coconut, these hearty morning glory muffins are moist and tender, with woodsy, spiced notes of cinnamon and ginger.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 1 hr 20 min.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: Once cooled, the muffins can be stored in an airtight container at room temperature for up to 3 days or refrigerated for up to 1 week.\nMuffins can be individually wrapped in plastic wrap or stored in an airtight zip-top bag and frozen for up to 3 months. Thaw at room temperature or warm in a microwave or 325ºF (160ºC) oven.",
